---
description: Always bump and tell the user the EFB version.
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

When you change the EFB app (UI, map, server, navdata, traffic), increment `VERSION` (semver, currently `0.16.478`). The map shows `v…` bottom-center; `index.html` uses `{{VERSION}}` for cache-bust.

In the user-facing reply, always state the new version, e.g. **v0.10.1**.
